 ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
diff --git a/newsfragments/genesys_gl128_8200i_se_parity.backend b/newsfragments/genesys_gl128_8200i_se_parity.backend
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..c094bb8c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/newsfragments/genesys_gl128_8200i_se_parity.backend
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+genesys: Plustek OpticFilm 8200i SE (GL128): scan the whole film gate, choose the front-end gain from the lit gate, added 8-bit output, the infrared scan source and the IntelliScan and QuickScan buttons.
